n will wipe out all of the  things that Congress actually votes on  because I don't see any will to change  the entitlement programs right now so  then what makes you optimistic what  makes me optimistic is technology and  invention and the human spirit to  improve our own lives you know I'm my  background is an engineer have 29  patents I have invented things and when  people say where children be better off  than we were let's say well absolutely  they will because society doesn't forget  the things that invented and we invent  more things and so you know we've got  smartphones now and we've got ebay and  things that really made life better for  us thanks to technology and so when  people say we're going to be better off  I say yes but it's going to be due to  the engineers not the politicians well  we will leave it there thank you so much  we've been talking with congre  when thomas massie from kentucky for  reason TV i'm nick gillespie at the  international students for liberty  conference
 

